  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All forms of wealth that you carry or own, other than magic items, are lost to you. Portable property vanishes. Businesses, buildings, and land you own are lost in a way that alters reality the least. If you have a @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.content.JournalEntry.dmgBastions00000]{Bastion}, it is <span class=\"no-break\">destroyed</span> by some calamity beyond your control. Any documentation that proves you should own something lost to this card also disappears.</p>",
